    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "信号（Signal Browser Definition）：Define normalized order backlog as order backlog (ob) divided by average total assets (at) in years t-1 and t. Exclude if order backlog is 0. Signal is normalized order backlog minus normalized order backlog one year ago. 组合规则（该页字段）：StockWeight=EW；LSQuantile=0.1；PortfolioPeriod=12.0个月；StartMonth=6.0；Sign=1.0；TestInOP=port sort。股票池/过滤：过滤列为空；定义/注释中的股票池限制：Define normalized order backlog as order backlog (ob) divided by average total assets (at) in years t-1 and t. Exclude if order backlog is 0. Signal is normalized order backlog minus normalized order backlog one year ago.。 Notes：OP is more aggressive than most and assumes a 4 month lag between fiscal year end and data availability. We do the standard 6 month.。 基线为原论文分组的多空组合（FAQ：baseline follows the original paper split）。未在该行写出的细节不补。"
